  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agroforestry Technical Education Centre Wawashang Phase V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide vocational training on agroforestry and woodwork to vulnerable youth living in rural areas. Lack of education, high drop-out rates, high levels of violence, sexual exploitation and drug abuse are among the factors that endanger the future of young women and men of different ethnic groups in the Caribbean Coast. In Wawashang Agroforestry School, they acquire knowledge and tools to find meaningful work, and develop life skills such as leadership and solidarity.</narrative>
  </description>
